# The RTS's session in M1 (320 x 240 x 8, lines doubled):
#   heron mini_gfx run games/rts --poke mode=1 --script studies/mini_gfx/games/rts/m1.script
# The screen's coordinates are the cursor's (640 x 480); the HUD starts
# at line 384. Start-up takes 60-85 frames.
120 mouse 330 210
130 shot m1_start
# a selection rectangle round the soldiers right of the hall
140 drag 250 190 380 340 30
165 shot m1_drag
180 click 590 250 2
250 shot m1_move
# scroll right at the screen's edge
270 mouse 639 250
330 shot m1_scroll
340 mouse 400 250
# the minimap: the enemy's hall, then home
360 click 120 456
400 shot m1_enemy
420 click 20 404
430 key +
440 key +
450 key +
470 key 4
530 shot m1_full
550 key 1
610 shot m1_dirty
630 key 3
690 shot m1_double
700 stop
